## Model card

- **Name:** Agnes 2.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Sapiens AI's high-throughput flash-tier MoE model with 512K context, tool calling, prompt caching, and adaptive thinking mode. Text + image in; text out.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen (`opencode/agnes-2.5-flash`), Sapiens AI API. Supports tool calling and prompt caching.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date not publicly specified; knowledge cutoff not publicly specified.
- **IDs:** `opencode/agnes-2.5-flash` (OpenCode Zen); `sapiens/agnes-2.5-flash` (Sapiens AI).
- **Context window:** 512,000 total (per meta.json)
- **Modalities:** Text, image in; text out; tool calls; prompt caching; adaptive thinking mode
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** $0.05 / $0.15 per 1M (input / output); $0 trial tier available (per meta.json).
- **Architecture:** MoE (Mixture of Experts); proprietary; parameter count not disclosed.

